== Redmine Tags plugin changelog

Redmine Tags plugin - Tags board plugin for redmine
Copyright (C) 2011-2026 Kirill Bezrukov (RedmineUP)
http://www.redmineup.com/

== 2026-09-04 v0.0.6

Development. Plugin ID: :redmineup_tags
Target: Redmine 7.0.0 / Ruby 3.4 / Rails 8.1
Version in init.rb: 0.0.6 (Development)
Docs: doc/RELEASE_0.0.6.md, doc/TEST_V006_TAG_COLORS.md

Tag colors
* Admin Edit / Merge: pastel swatch grid (45) + native color input + hex + Auto
* First 27 swatches unchanged; added stone / lime / teal / indigo / rose / amber
* Auto colors still MD5(name) + mute (palette is editor-only, not the auto range)
* Replaces RedmineUP $.fn.colorPicker on those pages
* Stored tags.color is slightly desaturated on chips (soften S×0.86), not muted
* Empty color still uses MD5(name) + mute; less white (t 0.34 → 0.20, max L 0.76 → 0.72)
* Chip text follows background luminance (light text on dark manual colors)
* Save normalizes to #rrggbb; Auto / blank clears the column
* Field name tag[color] unchanged for RedmineUP Q&A

== 2026-09-02 v0.0.5

Stable freeze. Plugin ID: :redmineup_tags
Target: Redmine 7.0.0 / Ruby 3.4 / Rails 8.1
Version in init.rb: 0.0.5 (Stable)
Git tag: v0.0.5 (to be created by maintainer)
Docs: doc/RELEASE_0.0.5.md

Boot / schema
* Zeitwerk: tag_cloud_untagged_patch.rb now defines RedmineupTags::Patches::TagCloudUntaggedPatch
  so rake redmine:plugins:migrate and Rails boot no longer raise NameError on Redmine 7 / Rails 8
* tag_cloud_preferences.show_untagged is created by migration 007 and SchemaRepair
  (boot / rake redmineup_tags:ensure_tables / script/extend_database.sh)
* tag_cloud_user_preferences.show_untagged is created by migration 008 and SchemaRepair
  (My account master switch; not dropped on force_rebuild)

Personal untagged caption
* Per-user per-cloud checkbox in Select visible tag clouds (not in the cloud form)
* Stored in tag_cloud_preferences.show_untagged; default off
* Only that user sees «untagged issues - N» / «без тегов - N» next to the cloud title
* Reset deletes preference rows → visibility, order and untagged checkboxes all revert
* Click opens the issue list with the cloud filters plus issue_tags !*
* If matching issues exist but all are tagged → «all issues are tagged» / «все задачи затегированы»

Personal untagged master switch (My account)
* My account → Tags: «Show untagged issues» next to «Show issue counts»
* Master off (default) hides modal Untagged column and all sidebar captions
* Profile checkbox is shown only for manage_tag_clouds or admin
* manage_tag_clouds includes select_tag_clouds (modal + personal order/visibility)
* Losing manage clears the stored master switch and per-cloud show_untagged flags
* Show issue counts stays available to every logged-in user (system + custom clouds)
* Modal Reset does not clear the My account master switch

Form copy
* Em dash replaced with hyphen in form texts, hints and untagged captions
* Hints shortened on My account, cloud form, plugin General and modal
* Tooltips removed (modal drag handle, S/R markers, system-scope title)

Issue list Tags filter
* Tags is (=) / is not (!) with several values is OR, same as Status / Tracker / Version
* Was match_all (AND: issue must have every selected tag)
* Now tagged_with any: true (issue matches if it has at least one selected tag)
* is not excludes issues that have any of the selected tags
* Same change in Time log filter and Agile board filter
* Field name stays issue_tags for RedmineUP Q&A
* Functional tests updated for OR; added test_filter_by_tags_equal_is_or_not_and

See git history for 0.0.4 and earlier notes.
